// ApplicationCreate Create-side write serializer for the application "Add" form.
//
// Per ADR-018 §5, create and the settings update are materially different — create requires the
// core fields, has no stored secrets to backfill, and sets the new resource's criticality /
// in_scope — so this is a distinct “*CreateSerializer“ rather than folding into
// “ApplicationSettingsWriteSerializer“. It still reuses that serializer's scan-target and auth
// validation against a fresh (unsaved) Application passed via context.
