// ExternalRuleSource Read + write serializer for an org's self-serve external rule sources.
//
// “organization“ is never a client input — it is taken from the URL/context in the viewset and
// used to scope “installed_integration“ and the “(organization, repo_url, branch)“ uniqueness
// check. “repo_url“ inherits the model's HTTPS-only validator and adds an SSRF host guard.
