	//
	// Make this run its dataset's champion — the default side of every comparison.
	//
	// The one write in this API (see the module docstring). `promote_baseline` demotes the
	// previous champion in the same transaction, so the dataset's `is_baseline` uniqueness
	// constraint holds, and it refuses anything but a `completed` run: a partial run's metrics
	// describe whichever subset happened to score, and promoting one would silently move the
	// reference every later comparison is read against.
