	// Lightweight initial-scan status for the app-wide React poller.
	//
	// Distinct from ``OnboardingViewSet`` (admin-only ``org_settings:read``): the scan-complete
	// notice belongs to whoever started the scan during signup, who need not be an admin, so the
	// endpoint is reachable by any member and the payload decides. ``initial_scan`` is ``null``
	// once there is no tracked scan, the caller did not start it, or they have already acknowledged
	// it — so polling stops on its own.
